      "textOverrides": {
        "frame.name": "Taxbriber",
        "bg.hand-size": "10",
        "content.notes": "- custom: '%p_font-size:1em%You can manipulate allies and enemies for your wishes by performing %b%Bribe%be% %classToken0:i% abilities. To %classToken0:i% an enemy, put 1 loot token you have in its hex. To %classToken0:i% an ally, you give them %b%1 loot token%be% you have. Allies also may %classToken0:i% you to gain some nice benefits. Note that you can %classToken0:i% %b%only character allies%be%.'\n- divider: \n- custom: 'Frosthaven special rules. 1. If you %classToken0:i% an ally, randomly give them 1 of your loot cards. 2. If you %classToken0:i% an enemy, randomly shuffle back into the loot deck 1 of your loot cards. 3. If %classToken0:i% with a looted item, give it in the same state to an ally or return this item to the shop, respectively.'\n  color: '#f3e9d2'\n  backgroundColor: 'rgba(224, 160, 64, 0.18)'\n  border: '1px solid #e0a040'\n  borderRadius: 8px\n  padding: 8px 12px\n  lineHeight: 1\n- divider: \n- custom: '%p_font-size:1em%You have many %loot% %b%abilities%be% to fuel your other abilties. Communicate with allies and plan your and enemy placement on the map carefully.'\n  lineHeight: 1"
      },
